  "description": "<h3>Brand Balance is hiring for Content Creator<\/h3><p><h3>About the Company<\/h3><p>Brand Balance Pvt. Ltd. is a full-service creative and marketing agency working across branding, digital, films, and large-format campaigns for both government and private sector clients. We handle projects that actually go out into the world launches, on-ground campaigns, storytelling, and digital ecosystems that need speed, clarity, and strong execution. We value people who take ownership, move fast, and don’t need hand-holding.<\/p><h3>Responsibilities<\/h3><p>We are looking for someone who can handle content end-to-end. Not just plan it. Not just write about it. We need someone who can think it, shoot it, create it, and publish it. This is a hands-on role. You will be expected to work independently and drive content from idea to execution.<\/p><ul><li>Plan and execute monthly content calendars<\/li><li>Develop reels, short-form videos, and static creatives<\/li><li>Shoot content during events, visits, and campaigns (often yourself)<\/li><li>Write captions, scripts, and campaign messaging<\/li><li>Coordinate and manage in-house shoots from concept to execution<\/li><li>Edit quick-turnaround videos and social-first content<\/li><li>Post and manage content across Instagram, LinkedIn, YouTube, and Facebook<\/li><li>Track performance and refine content based on what works<\/li><\/ul><h3>Requirements<\/h3><p>Experience: 0-4 Years (Freshers with strong portfolios are also welcome)<\/p><ul><li>2-4 years of experience in content creation or digital marketing<\/li><li>Strong writing and storytelling ability<\/li><li>Comfortable shooting content on phone\/camera and directing basic setups<\/li><li>Working knowledge of Canva, Adobe tools, or similar platforms<\/li><li>Basic video editing skills (Premiere Pro, CapCut, etc.)<\/li><li>Understanding of how different platforms behave and what works where<\/li><li>Ability to manage multiple projects and meet deadlines<\/li><li>Work closely with design, video, and marketing teams to deliver campaigns<\/li><li>Stay updated with trends without losing brand relevance<\/li><\/ul><p>You’ll Fit In Well If You<\/p><ul><li>Take initiative instead of waiting for instructions<\/li><li>Are comfortable being on-ground and making things happen<\/li><li>Can balance creativity with execution speed<\/li><li>Prefer doing the work over making presentations about it<\/li><li>Are organised, dependable, and solutions-oriented<\/li><\/ul><\/p>",
